<title>UK: CRICKET-MIDDLESEX V AUSTRALIA FINAL DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MIDDLESEX V AUSTRALIA FINAL DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
